1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
<S:SPEAKER_00|G:Male> Ever heard the phrase, bite the bullet?

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,019
<S:SPEAKER_00|G:Male> It's not just a saying.

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,160
<S:SPEAKER_00|G:Male> Soldiers actually did it.

4
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:10,099
<S:SPEAKER_00|G:Male> Back in the day, during battlefield surgeries, there was no anesthesia.

5
00:00:10,439 --> 00:00:14,900
<S:SPEAKER_00|G:Male> So they bit down on a bullet to focus the pain and keep from screaming.

6
00:00:15,619 --> 00:00:18,320
<S:SPEAKER_00|G:Male> Next time you hear it, you'll know it came from real pain.

7
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,559
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> Divya, why are you doing this today?

8
00:00:21,699 --> 00:00:23,140
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> I'm going to bite the bullet today.

9
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,000
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> Wait, do you know what bite the bullet means?

10
00:00:26,219 --> 00:00:26,920
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> Let me tell you.

11
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:31,660
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> It means to finish the work no matter how unsatisfying or unpleasant it is.

12
00:00:31,839 --> 00:00:33,359
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> Now I'm going to bite the bullet.

13
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,320
<S:SPEAKER_01|G:Female> Bye guys.

